OL,3,GNEWSACouncil unveils draft plan for
OL,4,A34,000 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA draft Local Plan setting out where
OL,7,Falmost 34,000 homes could be built
OL,8,Facross Bradford district by 2043 has
OL,9,Fbeen published.
OL,11,FThe 1,290-page document identifies
OL,12,Fsites for up to 33,670 homes and more
OL,13,Fthan 272 acres (110 hectares) of
OL,14,Femployment land, including locations in
OL,15,FManningham, Shipley and near Forster
OL,16,FSquare Retail Park.
OL,18,FThe plan, which has been delayed for
OL,19,Fseveral years, will go out to public
OL,20,Fconsultation later this month before
OL,21,Fbeing considered by councillors.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
