OL,3,GNEWSACouncil unveils draft plan for
OL,4,A34,000 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy council leader Andrew Judson
OL,7,Fsaid it would give the authority a
OL,8,F"much greater ability to shape where
OL,9,Fdevelopment happens and to resist
OL,10,Finappropriate development".
